n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod 应用进程无法提供正常的就绪服务。K8s 就绪探针（Readiness Probe）探测 Pod IP (172.16.104.26) 的 8080 端口，早期表现为 `connection refused`，随后应用进程启动但业务逻辑返回 `HTTP 503` 错误，具体日志显示 `dependency unavailable`（见证据 5、6）。应用进程运行正常（非 OOM 或 CrashLoop），但因依赖不可用而无法通过就绪检查。\n\n**证据不足与未知：**\n正式 RCA 中明确标注 `diagnostic_status: inconclusive`。目前事实仅能证明“依赖不可用”这一抽象结果，但缺少以下决定性事实：\n1. **具体依赖实体不明**：日志中只记录了 `dependency unavailable` 模式，未包含导致该错误的上游服务名称或具体资源标识（如数据库、缓存、其他微服务）。\n2. **探针行为逻辑不明**：日志聚合仅针对 `/work` 路径的 503，而 K8s 事件中 `/ready` 探针同样失败（包括早期的连接拒绝），应用为何在依赖不可用时连 `/ready` 也无法成功响应，其内部逻辑联系尚不清晰。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 171.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 171.3s (Evidence 162.5s, RCA 8.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 205.84, "metrics": {"run_id": "b2aec9c53d364d8a", "mttr": {"value": "3.4m", "seconds": 205.84674787521362, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 205846.74787521362, "llm_calls": 26, "llm_duration_ms": 156900.11382102966, "tool_calls": 39, "executed_tool_calls": 34, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 37, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 101354.16293144226, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 48214.160442352295}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18841.820240020752, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 171305.72938919067, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 15677.009582519531, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

